<title>USA: LSI Logic names Kent as Treasurer.</title>
<headline>LSI Logic names Kent as Treasurer.</headline>
<dateline>MILPITAS, Calif 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>LSI Logic Corp said it named Mark P. Kent as Treasurer.</p>
<p>Kent, 37, will report to R. Douglas Norby, LSI Logic executive vice president &amp; chief financial officer.</p>
<p>He joined LSI Logic two years ago as assistant treasurer. Prior to that, Kent was a partner in the treasury consulting firm of Feldmann, Kent &amp; Associates.  He has also held a variety of corporate banking positions, including a specialty in lending to high-tech corporations.</p>
</text>
